menu "Networking"

    config NET_WIFI
        bool "WiFi station"
        default n
        help
            Bring up the WiFi driver at boot (credentials from `wifi set`).
            Off: net:: is compiled as stubs that report "off", the WiFi
            driver isn't linked, and the RAM it would take at init goes to
            the database balloon instead. Turn on for the distributed
            database work.

endmenu
